---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Hosting & Domain Guides | Hostamble" description="Beginner-friendly introductions to domains, shared web hosting, and WordPress hosting.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="START HERE" title="Your next step, made simple." description="Short answers to the early questions that come with getting a website online." icon="✳"/>
  <section class="guides-section section-pad"><div class="container"><div class="guide-grid">
    <article class="guide-card"><span>01 / DOMAINS</span><h2>How to choose your domain</h2><p>Pick a name that's easy to spell, matches your brand, and has a renewal price you understand. Search availability before making plans around a name.</p><a href="/domains">Search domains →</a></article>
    <article class="guide-card"><span>02 / HOSTING</span><h2>What is shared hosting?</h2><p>Shared hosting places multiple sites on a server and can be a cost-conscious fit for blogs, portfolios, and small business websites.</p><a href="/shared-hosting">Compare shared plans →</a></article>
    <article class="guide-card"><span>03 / WORDPRESS</span><h2>When should I choose WordPress?</h2><p>If you want a familiar content management system with themes and plugins, WordPress can be an approachable way to manage a website.</p><a href="/wordpress-hosting">See WordPress plans →</a></article>
  </div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
